<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>遛狗 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E9%81%9B%E7%8B%97/</link><description>Recent content in 遛狗 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E9%81%9B%E7%8B%97/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>宠物</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/social/pets/</link><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 23:40:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/social/pets/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这一篇拆成五个细化场景：遛狗时狗扑了邻居、去收容所问领养、狗吐了两天约兽医、朋友之间聊宠物、狗公园里两只狗打起来。前两个场景练的是&lt;strong&gt;社区的硬规矩&lt;/strong&gt;，中间一个练&lt;strong&gt;说清症状&lt;/strong&gt;，后两个练&lt;strong&gt;怎么聊、怎么收场&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>